WEBVTT

NOTE
The Lunar Cry strikes the planet near Tears Point.
Duration: approximately 42 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
The towering red Lunar Cry column plunges down through the clouds.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.170
It reaches the planet's surface.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:29.570
It erupts into a radiant burst of golden, crystalline energy.
